  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Alert",
    "Description",
    "Inline callout message for page-level or section-level context. Lower priority than Banner; higher persistence than Toast.",
    "Variants",
    "default   Neutral informational callout.\ninfo      Informational — blue.\nsuccess   Confirmation — green.\nwarning   Caution — amber.\ndanger    Error or critical — red.",
    "Style",
    "filled     Solid feedback background. For prominent callouts inside pages.\noutlined   Subtle border with white surface. For secondary or dense contexts.",
    "Labels & Content",
    "Title optional — use when the callout has a clear heading.\nOne sentence body explaining the situation.\nOptional action button for resolution; close button to dismiss.\nAnnounce via aria-live=polite (assertive for danger).",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Inline near the element it concerns\nDO   Pair with StatusIndicator icon\nDO   Use danger filled for blocking errors\nDO   Offer a clear resolution action",
    "DON'T   Use as a page-top notification (use Banner)\nDON'T   Use for transient outcomes (use Toast)\nDON'T   Hide critical errors behind outlined style\nDON'T   Stack multiple alerts without dividers"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
}
